module.exports = [{"id":"k8s-K8s是什么","module":"k8s","title":"K8s是什么","level":"core","summary":"Kubernetes 简称 K8s（K 和 s 中间八个字母），是 Google 开…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Kubernetes 简称 K8s（K 和 s 中间八个字母），是 Google 开源、现由 CNCF 托管的容器编排平台。面试开场可以这样说：它不是用来「造容器」的，而是用来在集群里统一管理大量容器——怎么部署、怎么扩缩、挂了怎么拉起来、服务之间怎么发现和访问。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和 Docker 的分工（口述边界）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Docker / containerd 等：单机上的镜像构建、容器启停，解决「这一台机器上怎么跑一个进程隔离环境」。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"K8s：跨多台机器，把应用声明成期望状态（要几个副本、用什么镜像、暴露什么端口），由控制面持续调谐到实际状态。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"所以背 K8s 定义时，关键词是 编排（Orchestration）、集群、声明式 API，而不是替代容器引擎。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"为什么叫编排"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"「编排」像乐队指挥：每个容器是一个乐手，K8s 负责："}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"决定在哪台 Node 上起哪个 Pod；"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"副本数不够就补，多了就缩；"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"节点或容器故障时按策略重建；"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"给服务一个稳定访问入口（Service、Ingress）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"没有 K8s 时，运维往往要写大量脚本 + 监控 + 手工扩缩；K8s 把这些能力产品化成 API 和控制器。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"生态里的位置"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"底层：Linux 内核（cgroups、namespace）做隔离。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"运行时：containerd、CRI-O 等（现网常见 containerd；早期文档常写 Docker，本质是 CRI 接口，不必绑死 Docker）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"上层：Helm 包管理、Prometheus 监控、Istio 等服务网格，都围绕 K8s 生态长出来。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"谁在用、面试语境"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"互联网、云原生微服务、大数据组件（Spark on K8s）等场景里，K8s 几乎是事实标准。Java 后端口述时可接一句：Spring Boot 打 jar 或打镜像，最终很多团队是 镜像 + Deployment + Service 上集群。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和「云厂商 K8s」的关系"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"EKS、ACK、TKE 等是托管控制面的 K8s：Master 组件由云厂商运维，用户主要管 Node 和工作负载。原理和自建集群一致，面试说「用的还是 Kubernetes API 和对象模型」即可。"}]},{"type":"code","text":"flowchart TB\n  subgraph 用户\n    dev[开发/运维]\n  end\n  subgraph K8s集群\n    cp[控制面 Master]\n    nodes[工作节点 Node]\n  end\n  subgraph 单机能力\n    rt[容器运行时 containerd 等]\n  end\n  dev -->|kubectl YAML| cp\n  cp --> nodes\n  nodes --> rt"}]},{"id":"k8s-K8s是什么-追问","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"K8s 和 Docker Compose 差别？Compose 偏单机多容器一键起；…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"K8s 和 Docker Compose 差别？Compose 偏单机多容器一键起；K8s 面向多机集群、自愈、滚动发布和服务发现，规模和生产运维能力不在一个量级。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-K8s是什么"},{"id":"k8s-K8s是什么-追问-2","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"一定要会写 YAML 吗？生产靠 YAML/Helm/GitOps；面试讲清对象（P…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"一定要会写 YAML 吗？生产靠 YAML/Helm/GitOps；面试讲清对象（Pod、Deployment、Service）和 kubectl 常用命令即可，YAML 是把这些对象持久化。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-K8s是什么"},{"id":"k8s-K8s是什么-追问-3","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"K8s 是不是只能跑容器？主流是容器；也有 Kata、Wasm 等扩展，面试一般答「…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"K8s 是不是只能跑容器？主流是容器；也有 Kata、Wasm 等扩展，面试一般答「以容器为主、通过 CRI 接运行时」足够。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-K8s是什么"},{"id":"k8s-K8s是用来解决什么问题的","module":"k8s","title":"K8s是用来解决什么问题的","level":"core","summary":"容器把应用和环境打包好了，但一堆容器散在多台机器上时，新问题来了：谁在哪台机起、挂了…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"容器把应用和环境打包好了，但一堆容器散在多台机器上时，新问题来了：谁在哪台机起、挂了自己知不知道、流量怎么均衡、版本怎么无损升级。K8s 要解决的就是大规模容器运维里的共性痛点，让开发少碰机器细节，运维从「手工脚本」变成「声明期望状态」。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"故障自愈"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"容器进程退出、节点宕机、健康检查失败时，K8s 的控制器会对比期望副本数和实际存活数，自动在新节点或原节点重建 Pod。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"口述例子：Deployment 声明 "},{"t":"code","v":"replicas: 3"},{"t":"text","v":"，其中一个 Pod 被 OOM 杀掉，ReplicaSet 控制器会再创建一个，直到又是三个 Ready。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"这和单纯 "},{"t":"code","v":"docker run"},{"t":"text","v":" 不同：单机 docker 挂了通常要人介入或外部监控脚本拉起。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"负载与调度避开"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Scheduler 根据资源请求（CPU、内存）、亲和/反亲和、污点容忍等，把 Pod 放到合适且相对空闲的 Node 上，避免某几台机器被打满、其他机器闲置。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"还可以用反亲和把同一服务的多个副本分散到不同节点，降低单点故障拖垮整服务的风险。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"水平扩容"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"业务高峰时可以把 Deployment 的 "},{"t":"code","v":"replicas"},{"t":"text","v":" 从 3 调到 10，或配合 HPA（Horizontal Pod Autoscaler）按 CPU/自定义指标自动扩缩。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"缩容时按策略优雅终止 Pod，配合 PDB（PodDisruption Budget）避免一次干掉太多副本。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"容器之间的依赖与协作"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"微服务往往有启动顺序、配置依赖、网络互通需求。K8s 用："}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Service 给一组 Pod 稳定 DNS 和虚拟 IP；"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"ConfigMap / Secret 注入配置和密钥；"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Init 容器 做前置检查或等待依赖就绪；"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"探针 区分「进程活着」和「可以接流量」。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"这样应用不用写死 IP，也不用每台机器手工改 hosts。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"期望状态与解放运维细节"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"用户提交的是声明：「我要这个镜像、这么多个、这么暴露」。Controller Manager 里各种控制器不断调谐（Reconcile）实际集群 toward 声明。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"运维从「每台机器 ssh 改配置、重启进程」转向「改 YAML / GitOps、让系统收敛」，更适合 CI/CD 和可审计的变更。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和「只上 Docker」对比（口述表）"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 痛点 | 仅容器引擎 | K8s |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"|------|------------|-----|"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 多机调度 | 自建或人工 | Scheduler 内置 |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 副本与自愈 | 外部脚本 | Deployment / RS |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 服务发现 | 注册中心或手工 | Service + DNS |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 滚动升级 | 蓝绿脚本 | RollingUpdate 策略 |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 配置密钥 | 挂卷或 env 手工 | ConfigMap / Secret 一等公民 |"}]}]},{"id":"k8s-K8s是用来解决什么问题的-追问","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"K8s 能替代注册中心吗？Service 集群内发现够用；跨集群、复杂元数据、多语言…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"K8s 能替代注册中心吗？Service 集群内发现够用；跨集群、复杂元数据、多语言老系统仍常用 Nacos/Eureka 等，可并存。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-K8s是用来解决什么问题的"},{"id":"k8s-K8s是用来解决什么问题的-追问-2","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"无状态和有状态都能解决吗？无状态最顺；有状态靠 StatefulSet + PVC …","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"无状态和有状态都能解决吗？无状态最顺；有状态靠 StatefulSet + PVC + 运维规范，数据库有时仍裸机或云 RDS，看团队。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-K8s是用来解决什么问题的"},{"id":"k8s-K8s是用来解决什么问题的-追问-3","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"小团队有必要上 K8s 吗？学习成本高；实例少可用 Compose 或单机；当多环境…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"小团队有必要上 K8s 吗？学习成本高；实例少可用 Compose 或单机；当多环境、多服务、要弹性与标准化发布时再上，面试答「看规模与运维成熟度」。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-K8s是用来解决什么问题的"},{"id":"k8s-简述K8s的架构和工作原理","module":"k8s","title":"简述K8s的架构和工作原理","level":"core","summary":"K8s 集群从逻辑上分成 控制面（Control Plane，常叫 Master） …","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"K8s 集群从逻辑上分成 控制面（Control Plane，常叫 Master） 和 工作节点（Worker Node）。控制面负责「决策和存状态」；节点负责「真正跑容器」。所有对外操作（kubectl、控制器、组件间调用）都围绕 API 和 etcd 里的对象状态 转。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"控制面做什么"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"kube-apiserver：唯一入口，REST API，认证授权、准入、持久化到 etcd。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"kube-scheduler：监听未绑定节点的 Pod，选一台合适的 Node 并写入绑定关系。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"kube-controller-manager：一组控制器（Deployment、ReplicaSet、Node、Service 等）循环对比期望与实际，发出创建/删除/更新指令。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"etcd：分布式 KV，存集群所有对象与状态，控制面的「真相源」。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"控制面可以物理多副本做高可用（多 apiserver + etcd 集群），面试说「etcd 挂了集群不能安全改状态」即可。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"工作节点做什么"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"每台 Node 上典型有："}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"kubelet：接收 apiserver（或本地配置）指令，驱动本机 Pod 生命周期（拉镜像、启停容器、上报状态）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"kube-proxy：维护节点上的 iptables/IPVS 规则，实现 Service 的集群内负载均衡。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"容器运行时：containerd 最常见；历史材料写 Docker，现网多通过 CRI 接 containerd/CRI-O。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Node 向 apiserver 注册自己，并定期上报心跳；NotReady 的节点上的 Pod 会被迁移或标记，由控制器处理。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"工作原理（口述一条链）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"用户 "},{"t":"code","v":"kubectl apply"},{"t":"text","v":" 一份 Deployment YAML。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"apiserver 校验并写入 etcd。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Deployment 控制器 发现新期望，创建或更新 ReplicaSet。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"ReplicaSet 控制器 保证 Pod 副本数，创建 Pod 对象（此时可能还未调度）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Scheduler 给 Pod 指定 "},{"t":"code","v":"spec.nodeName"},{"t":"text","v":"。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"对应 kubelet 看到绑定到本机的 Pod，调用 运行时 拉镜像起容器，并更新 Pod 状态回 apiserver。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"整个过程是异步、声明式、可重入的：任何组件重启后读 etcd 继续调谐。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"架构图（背诵用）"}]},{"type":"code","text":"flowchart TB\n  subgraph ControlPlane[控制面 Master]\n    API[kube-apiserver]\n    SCH[kube-scheduler]\n    CM[kube-controller-manager]\n    ETCD[(etcd)]\n    API --- ETCD\n    SCH --> API\n    CM --> API\n  end\n  subgraph Node1[工作节点]\n    KL1[kubelet]\n    KP1[kube-proxy]\n    RT1[containerd/CRI]\n    KL1 --> RT1\n    KP1 --> KL1\n  end\n  USER[kubectl/控制器] --> API\n  API --> KL1\n  KL1 --> API"},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和「工作原理」相关的两个词"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"声明式：说「要三个副本」，不说「在第 2 步 ssh 起进程」。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"调谐循环：控制器反复「当前几份？差几份？补或删」，直到一致或遇到不可恢复错误。"}]}]},{"id":"k8s-简述K8s的架构和工作原理-追问","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"Master 和 Node 之间谁主动连谁？kubelet、controller、s…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Master 和 Node 之间谁主动连谁？kubelet、controller、scheduler 等主动 watch/list apiserver；apiserver 不 ssh 到节点起容器，而是 kubelet 拉取分配给自己的 Pod。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-简述K8s的架构和工作原理"},{"id":"k8s-简述K8s的架构和工作原理-追问-2","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"Pod 落在哪台机器谁决定？Scheduler；kubelet 只跑已经绑定到本机 …","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Pod 落在哪台机器谁决定？Scheduler；kubelet 只跑已经绑定到本机 nodeName 的 Pod。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-简述K8s的架构和工作原理"},{"id":"k8s-简述K8s的架构和工作原理-追问-3","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"数据存在哪？业务数据在 PV/容器内；集群对象与状态在 etcd。备份恢复、升级 e…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"数据存在哪？业务数据在 PV/容器内；集群对象与状态在 etcd。备份恢复、升级 etcd 是集群运维重点。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-简述K8s的架构和工作原理"},{"id":"k8s-说说ApiServer与etcd等控制面组件","module":"k8s","title":"说说ApiServer与etcd等控制面组件","level":"core","summary":"控制面四个组件面试常一起问：kube-apiserver、kube-schedule…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"控制面四个组件面试常一起问：kube-apiserver、kube-scheduler、kube-controller-manager、etcd。背法：apiserver 是唯一门面；etcd 是存储；scheduler 派活；controller-manager 纠偏。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"kube-apiserver"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"集群的 REST API 入口，kubectl、kubelet、各控制器、调度器都通过它读写对象。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"负责 认证（Authentication）、授权（Authorization）、准入控制（Admission），非法或不合策略的请求直接拒绝。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"写操作持久化到 etcd；读可以走缓存（如 informer）减轻 etcd 压力。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"设计上强调 无状态、可水平扩展；前面常挂负载均衡，多副本 apiserver 共享同一 etcd。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"口述：所有变更都经 apiserver，没有「绕过 apiserver 直接改 etcd」的正规路径（运维 emergency 另说）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"kube-scheduler"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"监听 尚未绑定 nodeName 的 Pod（Pending 且已满足调度前提）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"过滤（Filter）：资源够不够、污点、亲和、端口冲突等。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"打分（Score）：优选资源均衡、亲和策略满足的节点。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"绑定（Bind）：把 "},{"t":"code","v":"nodeName"},{"t":"text","v":" 写回 Pod（经 apiserver）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"默认调度器可替换或扩展（调度框架、二次开发），面试一般讲默认流程即可。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"kube-controller-manager"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"一个进程里跑多个控制器，每个控制器负责一类资源的生命周期，例如："}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Deployment 控制器：维护 Deployment → ReplicaSet → Pod 层级关系；"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"ReplicaSet 控制器：保证 Pod 副本数；"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Node 控制器：节点失联时标记、驱逐 Pod；"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Service 控制器：云 LoadBalancer 类型时对接云 API（若启用）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"核心模式：List-Watch apiserver → 对比期望与实际 → 调 apiserver 写差异。这叫 Reconcile（调谐）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"etcd"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"高可用 键值存储，保存 K8s 所有 API 对象（Pod、Service、Secret 等）的 JSON/Protobuf 序列化数据。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"强一致语义对控制面很重要：谁写成功、版本号（resourceVersion）如何，决定并发更新行为。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"备份与恢复 etcd 等于备份集群「大脑」；生产必须定期 snapshot。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"etcd 不跑业务容器；只服务 apiserver。集群外不应让应用直连 etcd。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"组件协作（时序口述）"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"新建 Pod 对象 → apiserver 入 etcd → Scheduler 绑定节点 → ReplicaSet/其他控制器 无需再调度已绑定的 → kubelet watch 到本机 Pod → 起容器 → 状态经 apiserver 回写 → 各控制器 根据 Ready/Failed 继续调谐。"}]},{"type":"code","text":"sequenceDiagram\n  participant C as Controller/Scheduler\n  participant API as kube-apiserver\n  participant E as etcd\n  C->>API: List/Watch/Patch Pod 等\n  API->>E: 持久化\n  API-->>C: 事件与对象"},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"cloud-controller-manager（扩展一句）"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"云上集群常有 cloud-controller-manager，负责 Node 路由、LoadBalancer、Volume 等与云 API 对接的控制器，与 kube-controller-manager 分工，面试提到「云上 LB 型 Service」时可带出。"}]}]},{"id":"k8s-说说ApiServer与etcd等控制面组件-追问","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"apiserver 挂了会怎样？已有 Pod 在 Node 上可能继续跑，但无法可靠…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"apiserver 挂了会怎样？已有 Pod 在 Node 上可能继续跑，但无法可靠变更集群对象；watch 断开的组件会重连。生产 apiserver 多副本 + LB。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说ApiServer与etcd等控制面组件"},{"id":"k8s-说说ApiServer与etcd等控制面组件-追问-2","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"scheduler 和 controller 能合并吗？架构上分开；小规模实验可同机…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"scheduler 和 controller 能合并吗？架构上分开；小规模实验可同机部署，逻辑仍是两个角色。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说ApiServer与etcd等控制面组件"},{"id":"k8s-说说ApiServer与etcd等控制面组件-追问-3","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"为什么 etcd 要奇数节点？Raft quorum，容忍 (N-1)/2 故障；3…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"为什么 etcd 要奇数节点？Raft quorum，容忍 (N-1)/2 故障；3 节点 tolerate 1，5 节点 tolerate 2。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说ApiServer与etcd等控制面组件"},{"id":"k8s-说说Node上的Kubelet与KubeProxy","module":"k8s","title":"说说Node上的Kubelet与KubeProxy","level":"core","summary":"工作节点上跟面试最相关的三个角色：kubelet、kube-proxy、容器运行时（…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"工作节点上跟面试最相关的三个角色：kubelet、kube-proxy、容器运行时（现网多为 containerd，经 CRI 与 K8s 对接；教材里常写 Docker，口述可补一句「不必绑死 Docker」）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"kubelet 的定位"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"每台 Node 上的 节点代理，向 kube-apiserver 注册节点并上报 Node 状态（容量、可分配资源、Ready/NotReady）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"只负责 本机 上已调度过来的 Pod：创建 Pod 沙箱、拉镜像、按 spec 启停容器、挂载 Volume、执行 探针、上报 Pod/Container 状态。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"不决定 Pod 调度到哪；那是 Scheduler 的事。kubelet 看到 "},{"t":"code","v":"spec.nodeName == 本机"},{"t":"text","v":" 的 Pod 才动手。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"kubelet 和运行时"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"kubelet 通过 CRI（Container Runtime Interface）调用 containerd 等："}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"RunPodSandbox：Pod 级网络命名空间等；"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"CreateContainer / StartContainer：业务容器；"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"PullImage：拉取镜像。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"镜像来自仓库（Harbor、ACR 等），PullPolicy（Always/IfNotPresent）影响是否每次拉最新。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"kubelet 常见职责口述"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"静态 Pod：kubelet 直接读本地 manifest 目录起的 Pod（etcd 外），用于控制面组件自身。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"探针：按 period 调 HTTP/TCP/Exec，把结果反映到 Pod 状态，触发重启或从 Service Endpoints 摘掉。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"资源：可选 cgroup 限制、驱逐（Eviction）当节点磁盘/内存压力过大时按优先级删 Pod。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Device Plugin / CSI：挂载 GPU、持久卷等，kubelet 是节点侧协调者。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"kube-proxy 的定位"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"实现 Service 的 集群内访问与负载均衡（默认 ClusterIP）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"监听 Service 和 Endpoints（或 EndpointSlice）变化，在本机配置 iptables 或 IPVS 规则，把访问 "},{"t":"code","v":"ClusterIP:Port"},{"t":"text","v":" 的流量转发到后端 Pod IP。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"模式：iptables（默认较常见）、IPVS（大规模更高效）、userspace（老，少提）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"口述：Service 是稳定虚拟 IP + DNS；真正转发发生在各 Node 的 kube-proxy 规则上。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"kube-proxy 和 kubelet 的分工"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 组件 | 关注点 |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"|------|--------|"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| kubelet | 单个 Pod/容器生命周期、健康、卷 |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| kube-proxy | 多条 Pod 之上的 Service 流量分发 |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Ingress Controller 是另一层（七层 HTTP），和 kube-proxy 的四层 Service 互补，见 Service/Ingress 题。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Node 故障时发生什么"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"kubelet 停或节点断网 → Node 对象 NotReady → 控制器可能 驱逐 Pod 并在其它 Node 重建（取决于控制器类型和 PDB）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"所以 kubelet 心跳是集群感知节点健康的关键。"}]},{"type":"code","text":"flowchart LR\n  API[kube-apiserver]\n  KL[kubelet]\n  KP[kube-proxy]\n  CRI[containerd]\n  API -->|Pod spec| KL\n  KL --> CRI\n  API -->|Service/Endpoints| KP\n  KP -->|DNAT 到 Pod IP| POD[本机及其他 Pod]"}]},{"id":"k8s-说说Node上的Kubelet与KubeProxy-追问","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"kubelet 会连 docker.sock 吗？旧集群可能 docker shim…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"kubelet 会连 docker.sock 吗？旧集群可能 docker shim；新集群多为 containerd socket，由 CRI 统一。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说Node上的Kubelet与KubeProxy"},{"id":"k8s-说说Node上的Kubelet与KubeProxy-追问-2","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"没有 kube-proxy 能访问 Service 吗？可以换 eBPF/Ciliu…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"没有 kube-proxy 能访问 Service 吗？可以换 eBPF/Cilium 等数据面替代 iptables 实现；概念仍是 Service → 后端 Pod。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说Node上的Kubelet与KubeProxy"},{"id":"k8s-说说Node上的Kubelet与KubeProxy-追问-3","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"Pod 里容器谁拉起？kubelet 按 Pod spec 逐个通过运行时创建；Pa…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Pod 里容器谁拉起？kubelet 按 Pod spec 逐个通过运行时创建；Pause 容器（sandbox）常作为 Pod 网络命名空间 holder。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说Node上的Kubelet与KubeProxy"},{"id":"k8s-什么是Pod","module":"k8s","title":"什么是Pod","level":"core","summary":"Pod 是 Kubernetes 里最小调度单位，不是「最小容器单位」。一个 Pod…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Pod 是 Kubernetes 里最小调度单位，不是「最小容器单位」。一个 Pod 里可以跑一个或多个容器，它们被绑在一起：同生共死、调度到同一 Node、共享同一套网络与部分存储。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"为什么要有 Pod 而不是直接调度容器"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"K8s 需要 紧密协作 的容器组：例如主应用 + 日志 sidecar、应用 + 本地缓存代理。若两个容器分开调度，可能落到不同机器，localhost 互通就做不到了。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Pod 抽象把「总是一起部署、一起扩缩」的容器打包成一个原子单元交给 Scheduler。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"共享网络"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"同一 Pod 内所有容器共享 一个 IP 地址（Pod IP）和 同一组端口空间。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"容器之间用 localhost 互相访问，例如 "},{"t":"code","v":"127.0.0.1:8080"},{"t":"text","v":"，无需经过 Service。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"每个 Pod 在集群内有独立 IP；跨 Pod 访问走 Service DNS 或 Pod IP（一般不推荐硬编码 Pod IP）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Pause 容器（infra 容器）常持有网络命名空间，业务容器 join 进来。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"共享存储"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Pod 可挂载 Volume（emptyDir、ConfigMap、Secret、PVC 等），挂载路径可以多个容器共享同一卷，适合 sidecar 读日志、共享临时文件。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"emptyDir 随 Pod 生命周期销毁；PVC 是否保留取决于 PV 回收策略和 StatefulSet 等设计。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Pod 生命周期（口述）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Pending：已创建，可能还在拉镜像或调度。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Running：至少一个容器在跑。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Succeeded / Failed：终态；Job 类常见 Succeeded。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Unknown：节点通信异常。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Pod 本身通常不直接手写长期维护：生产多用 Deployment / StatefulSet 创建 Pod 模板，由控制器重建 Pod。直接 "},{"t":"code","v":"kubectl run"},{"t":"text","v":" 的裸 Pod 节点故障不会自动 elsewhere 重建（除非被控制器管）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"多容器模式（面试加分）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Sidecar：增强主容器（日志、代理、mesh）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Init 容器：按顺序跑完再启主容器，适合等依赖、改权限、拉配置。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Adapter：把主容器输出转成统一格式。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和 Deployment 的关系"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Deployment 管 ReplicaSet，ReplicaSet 管 Pod 模板。扩缩改的是副本数，每个副本是一个 Pod 实例。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"背法：调度器调度 Pod；Deployment 管 Pod 副本与更新策略。"}]},{"type":"code","text":"flowchart TB\n  subgraph Pod[一个 Pod]\n    P[Pause/网络]\n    A[容器A 主应用]\n    B[容器B sidecar]\n    V[(共享 Volume)]\n    A --- P\n    B --- P\n    A --- V\n    B --- V\n  end"}]},{"id":"k8s-什么是Pod-追问","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"一个 Pod 两个容器怎么分工通信？同 Pod IP，localhost + 端口；…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"一个 Pod 两个容器怎么分工通信？同 Pod IP，localhost + 端口；配置用共享 Volume 或 env。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-什么是Pod"},{"id":"k8s-什么是Pod-追问-2","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"Pod 和容器重启策略？Pod 有 restartPolicy（Always/OnF…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Pod 和容器重启策略？Pod 有 restartPolicy（Always/OnFailure/Never）；Deployment 默认 Always，失败容器由 kubelet 重启，整 Pod 仍是一个调度单元。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-什么是Pod"},{"id":"k8s-什么是Pod-追问-3","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"为什么删 Pod 会马上又冒出来？Deployment/RS 在调谐副本数，删单个 …","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"为什么删 Pod 会马上又冒出来？Deployment/RS 在调谐副本数，删单个 Pod 会再创建一个满足期望。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-什么是Pod"},{"id":"k8s-简述Kubernetes的工作流程","module":"k8s","title":"简述Kubernetes的工作流程","level":"core","summary":"面试常让「从 kubectl 提交到容器跑起来」走一遍。标准六步：kubectl →…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"面试常让「从 kubectl 提交到容器跑起来」走一遍。标准六步：kubectl → ApiServer → etcd → Controller → ReplicaSet → Scheduler → Kubelet。下面按时间顺序口述，每一步谁读写、对象怎么变。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"第一步：kubectl 提交"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"运维或 CI 执行 "},{"t":"code","v":"kubectl apply -f deployment.yaml"},{"t":"text","v":"。kubectl 把 YAML 转成 API 对象（如 Deployment），HTTPS 调 kube-apiserver（带 kubeconfig 里的证书或 Token 做认证）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"第二步：ApiServer 处理并写 etcd"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"apiserver 做认证、授权、准入（Mutating/Validating Webhook 可能改或拒资源）。通过后把 Deployment（及关联对象）持久化到 etcd，返回成功给 kubectl。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"此时可能还没有任何 Pod 在 Node 上跑，只是「期望状态」进了存储。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"第三步：Controller 感知并展开"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Deployment 控制器 watch 到 Deployment 创建或变更，根据 "},{"t":"code","v":"spec.template"},{"t":"text","v":" 创建或更新 ReplicaSet（同样经 apiserver 写 etcd）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"ReplicaSet 控制器 watch 到 ReplicaSet，发现当前 Pod 数少于 "},{"t":"code","v":"replicas"},{"t":"text","v":"，就创建 Pod 对象（Pod 的 spec 来自模板，但通常还没有 "},{"t":"code","v":"nodeName"},{"t":"text","v":"）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"第四步：ReplicaSet 维持副本语义"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"若 Pod 被删或失败，ReplicaSet 控制器继续创建新 Pod，直到数量匹配。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"这一步强调：Pod 对象已在 etcd 里，状态可能是 Pending。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"第五步：Scheduler 绑定节点"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"kube-scheduler watch 到 未调度 的 Pod（"},{"t":"code","v":"spec.nodeName"},{"t":"text","v":" 为空且可调度），经过滤和打分，选中某 Node，Patch Pod 写入 "},{"t":"code","v":"spec.nodeName"},{"t":"text","v":"。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"绑定信息经 apiserver 进 etcd；Scheduler 不直接调 kubelet。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"第六步：Kubelet 在本机起容器"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"目标 Node 上的 kubelet watch/list 到绑定本机的 Pod，调用 containerd（CRI） 拉镜像、创建 sandbox、启动容器，挂载 Volume，执行探针。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"状态（Running、Ready、重启次数等）上报 apiserver → etcd；Endpoints 控制器更新 Service 后端，kube-proxy 刷新规则，流量才可打到新 Pod。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"六步串讲（一行版）"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"用户声明 → apiserver 落库 → Deployment 出 RS → RS 出 Pod → Scheduler 派 Node → kubelet 起容器并回写状态。"}]},{"type":"code","text":"sequenceDiagram\n  participant U as kubectl\n  participant API as apiserver\n  participant E as etcd\n  participant D as Deployment控制器\n  participant R as ReplicaSet控制器\n  participant S as scheduler\n  participant K as kubelet\n  U->>API: apply Deployment\n  API->>E: 存 Deployment\n  D->>API: 创建/更新 ReplicaSet\n  R->>API: 创建 Pod\n  S->>API: bind nodeName\n  K->>API: watch Pod\n  K->>K: CRI 起容器\n  K->>API: 更新 Pod 状态"},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和更新、删除"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"改镜像/副本：同样经 apiserver；Deployment 触发 滚动更新 新 RS、逐步替换 Pod。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"删 Deployment：级联策略决定 RS、Pod 是否一起删；默认多数资源会清理下属 Pod。"}]}]},{"id":"k8s-简述Kubernetes的工作流程-追问","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"哪一步最可能卡住 Pending？常见：调度失败（资源不足、污点、亲和不满足）或 镜…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"哪一步最可能卡住 Pending？常见：调度失败（资源不足、污点、亲和不满足）或 镜像拉取失败、PVC 未绑定。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-简述Kubernetes的工作流程"},{"id":"k8s-简述Kubernetes的工作流程-追问-2","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"Controller 和 Scheduler 顺序？Pod 先被 RS 创建（无 n…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Controller 和 Scheduler 顺序？Pod 先被 RS 创建（无 nodeName），Scheduler 后绑定；两者都 watch apiserver，异步协作。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-简述Kubernetes的工作流程"},{"id":"k8s-简述Kubernetes的工作流程-追问-3","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"kubelet 如何知道该起哪个 Pod？只处理 nodeName 等于本机且未被删…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"kubelet 如何知道该起哪个 Pod？只处理 "},{"t":"code","v":"nodeName"},{"t":"text","v":" 等于本机且未被删除的 Pod；清单来自 apiserver watch，不是 ssh 下发命令。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-简述Kubernetes的工作流程"},{"id":"k8s-Deployment-StatefulSet-DaemonSet有什么区别","module":"k8s","title":"Deployment StatefulSet DaemonSet有什么区别","level":"core","summary":"三种都是工作负载控制器，管理 Pod 模板和副本，但适用场景、身份、存储、扩缩行为不…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"三种都是工作负载控制器，管理 Pod 模板和副本，但适用场景、身份、存储、扩缩行为不同。面试用「无状态 / 有状态 / 每节点一个」三条线讲清楚。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Deployment（无状态，最常用）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"适合 Web API、无状态微服务：Pod 彼此可互换，没有固定身份。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Pod 名随机后缀（如 "},{"t":"code","v":"app-7d8f9-xxxxx"},{"t":"text","v":"），删了重建是新 Pod、新 IP。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"支持 RollingUpdate、回滚、HPA 水平扩缩。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"存储通常用共享外部存储或对象存储；本地盘不是默认诉求。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Java Spring Boot 服务、Gateway、大部分 REST 服务默认选 Deployment。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"StatefulSet（有状态，稳定身份）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"适合 需要稳定网络标识、有序部署/扩缩 的工作负载：如 etcd、Kafka、Zookeeper、有主从概念的中间件（是否上 K8s 另议）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Pod 名 有序且稳定："},{"t":"code","v":"web-0"},{"t":"text","v":"、"},{"t":"code","v":"web-1"},{"t":"text","v":"…；Headless Service 提供 "},{"t":"code","v":"web-0.web.default.svc"},{"t":"text","v":" 这类 DNS。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"每个 Pod 可绑定独立 PVC 模板，扩缩时 web-2 会拿到与序号对应的存储（存储类要支持）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"扩缩可以动态做，但是 有序 的：扩容按 0→1→2 顺序；缩容按逆序，避免有状态集群脑裂。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"纠正绝对说法：不是「不能增减副本」，而是 不能当 Deployment 那样随意乱序替换；增减要理解顺序与存储绑定。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"更新策略常见 RollingUpdate（按序）或 OnDelete（人工删 Pod 才用新模板重建）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"DaemonSet（每个 Node 一份）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"保证（或尽量保证）每个匹配的 Node 上跑一个 Pod：日志采集（Fluentd）、监控 agent（node-exporter）、CNI/存储插件、kube-proxy 某些部署方式等。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"节点新增，DaemonSet 自动在新 Node 起 Pod；节点下线，对应 Pod 消失。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"不按「服务副本数」扩缩，而跟 集群节点数 走；一般不用 HPA 扩 DaemonSet「副本」。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"对比表（口述）"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 维度 | Deployment | StatefulSet | DaemonSet |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"|------|------------|-------------|-----------|"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| Pod 身份 | 随机，可替换 | 固定序号与 DNS | 每节点一个 |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 典型场景 | 无状态应用 | 有状态/有序集群 | 节点级 agent |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 扩缩 | 任意增减副本 | 可扩缩，有序 | 随 Node 数量 |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 存储 | 通常无绑死 PVC | 常 per-Pod PVC | 多为 hostPath/emptyDir |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 更新 | 滚动，maxSurge 等 | 有序滚动或 OnDelete | 滚动，全集群逐步 |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"选型口诀"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"随便哪个实例都能扛流量 → Deployment。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"第几个实例是谁、磁盘要跟名字走 → StatefulSet。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"每台机器都要跑一份 → DaemonSet。"}]},{"type":"code","text":"flowchart LR\n  subgraph dep[Deployment 3副本]\n    d1[Pod]\n    d2[Pod]\n    d3[Pod]\n  end\n  subgraph sts[StatefulSet]\n    s0[web-0]\n    s1[web-1]\n  end\n  subgraph ds[DaemonSet]\n    n1[Node1 Pod]\n    n2[Node2 Pod]\n  end"}]},{"id":"k8s-Deployment-StatefulSet-DaemonSet有什么区别-追问","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"StatefulSet 和 Deployment 能互换吗？无状态误用 Statef…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"StatefulSet 和 Deployment 能互换吗？无状态误用 StatefulSet 浪费 DNS/PVC 复杂度；有状态误用 Deployment 会导致存储与身份混乱，一般不互换。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-Deployment-StatefulSet-DaemonSet有什么区别"},{"id":"k8s-Deployment-StatefulSet-DaemonSet有什么区别-追问-2","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"Job/CronJob 呢？跑完即停的批任务用 Job；定时批处理 CronJob；…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Job/CronJob 呢？跑完即停的批任务用 Job；定时批处理 CronJob；和长期服务的三种控制器不同类。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-Deployment-StatefulSet-DaemonSet有什么区别"},{"id":"k8s-Deployment-StatefulSet-DaemonSet有什么区别-追问-3","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"DaemonSet 会调度到 Master 吗？看 污点容忍：默认 Master 有…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"DaemonSet 会调度到 Master 吗？看 污点容忍：默认 Master 有 taint，普通 DaemonSet 不上；监控 agent 常加 toleration 覆盖所有节点。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-Deployment-StatefulSet-DaemonSet有什么区别"},{"id":"k8s-说说Service和Ingress","module":"k8s","title":"说说Service和Ingress","level":"core","summary":"Pod IP 会变、副本有多份，集群内外需要稳定访问入口。Service 提供集群内…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Pod IP 会变、副本有多份，集群内外需要稳定访问入口。Service 提供集群内（及多种对外方式）的四层服务发现与负载均衡；Ingress 提供 HTTP/HTTPS 七层 的统一入口与路由规则。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Service 解决什么"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"为一组带相同 label selector 的 Pod 提供一个稳定虚拟 IP（ClusterIP） 和 DNS 名（如 "},{"t":"code","v":"my-svc.default.svc.cluster.local"},{"t":"text","v":"）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"访问 Service IP:Port 时，kube-proxy（或 CNI 替代实现）把流量 负载均衡 到后端 Ready 的 Pod IP。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Endpoints / EndpointSlice 对象维护「当前哪些 Pod IP 在池子里」，随 Pod 增删自动更新。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Service 类型（口述）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"ClusterIP（默认）：仅集群内访问；微服务互调最常用。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"NodePort：在每个 Node 上开端口（默认 30000–32767），外网可通过 "},{"t":"code","v":"NodeIP:NodePort"},{"t":"text","v":" 访问（生产常再配合外部 LB）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"LoadBalancer：云环境由 cloud-controller 申请云负载均衡器，把流量引到 NodePort/ Pod（视实现而定）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"ExternalName：DNS CNAME 到集群外域名，不做代理。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"无头 Service（"},{"t":"code","v":"clusterIP: None"},{"t":"text","v":"）不给虚拟 IP，DNS 直接解析到所有 Pod IP，StatefulSet 稳定主机名靠它。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Service 和 Pod 的关系"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Deployment 改 Pod 模板滚动升级，Pod IP 一批批换；Service 的 selector 不变，调用方始终访问同一个 Service 名，无需改配置。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Java 里把 JDBC、Redis、下游 HTTP 地址配成 K8s Service DNS 是常见做法。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Ingress 解决什么"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"多个 HTTP 服务不想每个都暴露一个 LoadBalancer（贵、IP 多）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Ingress 资源定义 Host、Path → 后端 Service 的路由规则（如 "},{"t":"code","v":"api.example.com/v1"},{"t":"text","v":" → "},{"t":"code","v":"svc-a"},{"t":"text","v":"）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"真正干活的是 Ingress Controller（Nginx Ingress、Traefik、云 ALB Ingress 等），它 watch Ingress + Service，配置七层转发、TLS 证书、限流等。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Ingress 是 七层；Service 默认是 四层 TCP/UDP。外部用户常见路径：Internet → LB/Ingress Controller → Service ClusterIP → Pod。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"对比小结"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| | Service | Ingress |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"|---|---------|---------|"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 层级 | L4（端口） | L7（HTTP 路由） |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 依赖 | kube-proxy / 数据面 | 需 Ingress Controller |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 典型用途 | 服务间、NodePort/LB 对外 | 统一域名、路径、HTTPS |"}]},{"type":"code","text":"flowchart LR\n  Client[外部客户端]\n  IC[Ingress Controller]\n  SVC[Service ClusterIP]\n  P1[Pod]\n  P2[Pod]\n  Client -->|HTTPS 七层| IC\n  IC --> SVC\n  SVC --> P1\n  SVC --> P2"},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和 Java 网关"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"集群内 Spring Cloud Gateway 仍可作为应用层网关；Ingress 是基础设施层入口。常见叠法：Ingress 做 TLS 与域名，Gateway 做鉴权与业务路由。"}]}]},{"id":"k8s-说说Service和Ingress-追问","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"ClusterIP 能集群外直接访问吗？默认不能；要 NodePort、LoadBa…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"ClusterIP 能集群外直接访问吗？默认不能；要 NodePort、LoadBalancer、Ingress 或 kubectl port-forward。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说Service和Ingress"},{"id":"k8s-说说Service和Ingress-追问-2","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"Service 没有 Endpoints 会怎样？selector 无匹配 Pod …","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Service 没有 Endpoints 会怎样？selector 无匹配 Pod 或 Pod 全 Not Ready，Service 存在但访问无后端，表现为连接失败。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说Service和Ingress"},{"id":"k8s-说说Service和Ingress-追问-3","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"Ingress 和 API Gateway 一样吗？Ingress 偏 K8s 原生…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Ingress 和 API Gateway 一样吗？Ingress 偏 K8s 原生 HTTP 入口；云 API Gateway 功能更全（计费、WAF），可替代或并存。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说Service和Ingress"},{"id":"k8s-说说ConfigMap和Secret","module":"k8s","title":"说说ConfigMap和Secret","level":"core","summary":"应用配置和敏感信息不应硬编码进镜像。K8s 用 ConfigMap 存非机密配置，用…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"应用配置和敏感信息不应硬编码进镜像。K8s 用 ConfigMap 存非机密配置，用 Secret 存机密数据（密码、证书、Token），再注入到 Pod 里使用，实现配置与镜像分离。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"ConfigMap"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"键值对或整文件内容，例如 "},{"t":"code","v":"application.yaml"},{"t":"text","v":"、日志级别、功能开关、下游 Service 地址（非密钥部分）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"创建："},{"t":"code","v":"kubectl create configmap"},{"t":"text","v":" 或 YAML "},{"t":"code","v":"data"},{"t":"text","v":" / "},{"t":"code","v":"binaryData"},{"t":"text","v":"。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"不加密存储（etcd 里仍是明文，依赖 RBAC 与 etcd 加密 at rest）；适合「敏感程度低、变更频繁」的配置。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Secret"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"类型如 Opaque（通用）、kubernetes.io/tls（证书）、docker-registry（拉私有镜像）等。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"data"},{"t":"text","v":" 字段是 Base64 编码，不是加密；生产要配合 RBAC、加密 at rest、外部密钥系统（Vault、云 KMS）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"面试如实说：Secret 是「敏感对象的 API 抽象 + 访问控制」，不是强加密保险箱。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"注入 Pod 的两种方式"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"环境变量"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"envFrom"},{"t":"text","v":" / "},{"t":"code","v":"valueFrom.configMapKeyRef"},{"t":"text","v":" / "},{"t":"code","v":"secretKeyRef"},{"t":"text","v":" 把键值注入容器环境。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"适合少量键；变更后通常要重启 Pod 才能读到新值（除非应用自己 watch，少见）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Volume 挂载"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"把 ConfigMap/Secret 挂成目录或文件（如 "},{"t":"code","v":"/etc/config/application.yml"},{"t":"text","v":"）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"ConfigMap 更新后，kubelet 会同步更新挂载文件（有延迟）；应用若支持 reload 可热更，Java Spring 常仍要滚动重启。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Secret 挂载可选 tmpfs（memory），减少落盘泄露面。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和镜像、Deployment 的配合"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"同一镜像打多环境：换 ConfigMap/Secret + 不同 Deployment 即可，不必 rebuild 镜像。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"CI/CD：配置走 GitOps（Argo CD）或流水线单独 apply ConfigMap，与应用发布解耦。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"使用注意（口述）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"大配置文件用 Volume 比一堆 env 更清晰。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Secret 不要 commit 到 Git 明文；用 Sealed Secrets、外部仓库或 CI 注入。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Java 应用：Spring "},{"t":"code","v":"spring.config.additional-location"},{"t":"text","v":" 指向挂载路径，或 env 覆盖 "},{"t":"code","v":"SPRING_*"},{"t":"text","v":"。"}]},{"type":"code","text":"flowchart TB\n  CM[ConfigMap]\n  SEC[Secret]\n  POD[Pod]\n  CM -->|env 或 volume| POD\n  SEC -->|env 或 volume| POD"},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和 Downward API"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Pod 还可注入 Downward API（本 Pod 名、Namespace、IP），与 ConfigMap/Secret 互补，用于日志标签或注册 metadata。"}]}]},{"id":"k8s-说说ConfigMap和Secret-追问","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"ConfigMap 更新了 Pod 会自动 reload 吗？env 方式一般不会；…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"ConfigMap 更新了 Pod 会自动 reload 吗？env 方式一般不会；volume 方式文件会变，是否生效看应用是否监听或重启。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说ConfigMap和Secret"},{"id":"k8s-说说ConfigMap和Secret-追问-2","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"Secret 和环境变量有什么风险？env 可能进进程列表、dump、日志；极敏感项…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Secret 和环境变量有什么风险？env 可能进进程列表、dump、日志；极敏感项优先 volume + 最小权限，或外部密钥挂载。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说ConfigMap和Secret"},{"id":"k8s-说说ConfigMap和Secret-追问-3","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"一个 ConfigMap 多个 Pod 共用可以吗？可以，多个 Deployment…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"一个 ConfigMap 多个 Pod 共用可以吗？可以，多个 Deployment 引用同一 ConfigMap；改一处影响所有引用方，发布要谨慎。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说ConfigMap和Secret"},{"id":"k8s-说说探针Liveness与Readiness","module":"k8s","title":"说说探针Liveness与Readiness","level":"core","summary":"K8s 通过 Probe（探针） 判断容器健康，驱动 重启 或 流量接入。面试重点分…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"K8s 通过 Probe（探针） 判断容器健康，驱动 重启 或 流量接入。面试重点分清 Liveness（存活） 和 Readiness（就绪）；顺带提 Startup（启动） 更完整。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"探针怎么测"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"三种探测方式："}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"HTTP GET：指定 path、port（可配 httpHeaders），看返回码是否在成功范围（通常 2xx/3xx）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"TCP Socket：对端口建连是否成功。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Exec：在容器内执行命令，退出码 0 为成功。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"公共参数："},{"t":"code","v":"initialDelaySeconds"},{"t":"text","v":"、"},{"t":"code","v":"periodSeconds"},{"t":"text","v":"、"},{"t":"code","v":"timeoutSeconds"},{"t":"text","v":"、"},{"t":"code","v":"failureThreshold"},{"t":"text","v":"、"},{"t":"code","v":"successThreshold"},{"t":"text","v":"。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Liveness Probe（存活探针）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"问：进程是否还「活着」、要不要重启。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"失败：kubelet 杀死容器并按 restartPolicy 重启（常见 CrashLoopBackOff 若一直失败）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"适用：死锁、无限阻塞等「进程在但已不能自愈」的情况。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"慎用：若探针过严或依赖未就绪，会把还在启动的应用反复杀掉。慢启动应用应加大 initialDelay 或改用 startupProbe。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Readiness Probe（就绪探针）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"问：是否可以接流量。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"失败：不重启容器；Pod 标记为 Not Ready，从 Service Endpoints 摘掉，负载均衡不再转发过来。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"适用：预热缓存、连 DB 尚未成功、优雅下线前主动 fail readiness 等。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"恢复成功后重新加入 Endpoints，流量 gradual 打回。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Startup Probe（启动探针）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"在容器启动阶段启用，成功之前禁用 liveness/readiness（避免启动慢被 liveness 误杀）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"适合 Java 冷启动、大 heap 应用：startup 给足时间，通过后再用较严的 liveness。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"行为对比（必背）"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 探针 | 失败后果 | 典型目的 |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"|------|----------|----------|"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| Liveness | 重启容器 | 进程僵死 |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| Readiness | 不接流量，不重启 | 未准备好或临时过载 |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| Startup | 未成功则继续等，可阻断其他探针 | 长启动保护 |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和 Java 应用"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Readiness 可指 "},{"t":"code","v":"/actuator/health/readiness"},{"t":"text","v":"（Spring Boot 2.3+ 分 liveness/readiness）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Liveness 用较「轻」的检查，避免 health 里调下游导致级联 fail。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"发布滚动时：新 Pod readiness 通过才进 Service，配合 maxUnavailable 保证可用性。"}]},{"type":"code","text":"stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --> Starting: 容器启动\n  Starting --> NotReady: readiness 失败\n  NotReady --> Ready: readiness 成功\n  Ready --> NotReady: readiness 再失败\n  Ready --> Restart: liveness 失败\n  Restart --> Starting: kubelet 重启"}]},{"id":"k8s-说说探针Liveness与Readiness-追问","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"两个探针能共用同一个 URL 吗？可以但不推荐；readiness 应更严（含依赖）…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"两个探针能共用同一个 URL 吗？可以但不推荐；readiness 应更严（含依赖），liveness 只证明 JVM/进程没挂。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说探针Liveness与Readiness"},{"id":"k8s-说说探针Liveness与Readiness-追问-2","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"探针失败 Pod 状态是什么？Readiness 失败 Pod 可能仍 Runnin…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"探针失败 Pod 状态是什么？Readiness 失败 Pod 可能仍 Running 但 Ready=False；Liveness 失败触发重启，RESTARTS 计数增加。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说探针Liveness与Readiness"},{"id":"k8s-说说探针Liveness与Readiness-追问-3","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"Exec 探针在 Java 容器里怎么写？例如 pgrep java 或调轻量脚本；…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Exec 探针在 Java 容器里怎么写？例如 "},{"t":"code","v":"pgrep java"},{"t":"text","v":" 或调轻量脚本；避免每次 full GC 的超重检查。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说探针Liveness与Readiness"},{"id":"k8s-说说滚动更新和回滚","module":"k8s","title":"说说滚动更新和回滚","level":"core","summary":"生产发版很少一次性停掉全部实例。Deployment 默认 RollingUpdat…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"生产发版很少一次性停掉全部实例。Deployment 默认 RollingUpdate（滚动更新）：逐步用新版本 Pod 替换旧版本，尽量保证服务可用。出问题要能 回滚 到上一版 ReplicaSet。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"滚动更新怎么工作"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"改 Deployment 的 Pod 模板（如镜像 tag）后，Deployment 控制器会："}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"创建带新模板的 ReplicaSet；"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"逐步 扩容新 RS、缩容旧 RS，直到旧 RS 副本为 0；"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"旧 RS 保留（默认 "},{"t":"code","v":"revisionHistoryLimit"},{"t":"text","v":"），便于回滚。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"新 Pod Readiness 通过后才继续扩新、缩旧，避免未就绪实例接流量。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"关键策略字段"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"spec.strategy.type: RollingUpdate"},{"t":"text","v":" 下："}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"maxSurge：更新期间允许超过期望副本数的 Pod 数（绝对值或百分比）。例如 replicas=3、maxSurge=1，最多同时 4 个 Pod。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"maxUnavailable：更新期间允许不可用的 Pod 数上限。例如 maxUnavailable=1，至少 2 个旧 Pod 可用（在 replicas=3 时）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"口述：maxSurge 偏「多起新的」；maxUnavailable 偏「能容忍几个旧的/新的暂时不可用」。两者配合控制发布速度与风险。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和 Readiness 的关系"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"滚动不是「时间到了就杀旧 Pod」，而是 新 Pod Ready → 再缩旧 Pod。Readiness 配不好会导致更新卡住或流量打到半启动实例。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"如何触发更新"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"kubectl set image deployment/myapp app=myapp:v2"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"kubectl apply -f"},{"t":"text","v":" 改镜像或 env（在 template 里）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"CI/CD 流水线改 manifest 后 apply"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"回滚"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Deployment 维护 revision 历史（每个 RS 对应一个 revision）："}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"查看："},{"t":"code","v":"kubectl rollout history deployment/myapp"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"回滚上一版："},{"t":"code","v":"kubectl rollout undo deployment/myapp"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"回滚到指定 revision："},{"t":"code","v":"kubectl rollout undo deployment/myapp --to-revision=3"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"本质是 把 Deployment 的 template 指回旧 RS 的模板，再触发一轮滚动，把 Pod 换回旧镜像。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"其它策略（对比一句）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Recreate：先杀光旧 Pod 再起新的，有 downtime，适合单副本或必须全停的任务。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"StatefulSet 滚动常 按序 更新，和 Deployment 并行替换不同。"}]},{"type":"code","text":"flowchart LR\n  subgraph 更新中\n    O1[旧 Pod v1]\n    O2[旧 Pod v1]\n    N1[新 Pod v2 Ready]\n  end\n  O1 --> 缩容\n  N1 --> 扩容"},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"发布实践（口述加分）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"先发 canary（单独 Deployment 或小比例）需配合 Ingress/服务网格，不全是 Deployment 内置。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"镜像用 不可变 tag（digest 或版本号），避免 "},{"t":"code","v":"latest"},{"t":"text","v":" 回滚对不上。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"配合 PDB 避免节点维护时同时干掉过多副本。"}]}]},{"id":"k8s-说说滚动更新和回滚-追问","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"更新卡住 ProgressDeadlineExceeded 常见原因？新 Pod 一…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"更新卡住 "},{"t":"code","v":"ProgressDeadlineExceeded"},{"t":"text","v":" 常见原因？新 Pod 一直 Not Ready（镜像错、探针严、资源不足），或 maxUnavailable 与副本数配置冲突。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说滚动更新和回滚"},{"id":"k8s-说说滚动更新和回滚-追问-2","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"只改 ConfigMap 会滚动吗？Deployment 默认不因 ConfigMa…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"只改 ConfigMap 会滚动吗？Deployment 默认不因 ConfigMap 变更自动滚 Pod；需改 template annotation 触发或手动 rollout restart。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说滚动更新和回滚"},{"id":"k8s-说说滚动更新和回滚-追问-3","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"undo 和直接改 YAML 回镜像区别？undo 用控制器记录的历史 RS；改 Y…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"undo 和直接改 YAML 回镜像区别？undo 用控制器记录的历史 RS；改 YAML 等价于声明式回退，效果都是 template 回到旧版本再滚动。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说滚动更新和回滚"},{"id":"k8s-Docker和K8s的关系是什么","module":"k8s","title":"Docker和K8s的关系是什么","level":"core","summary":"Docker（在面试语境里常指「镜像 + 容器引擎」）解决 单机 上如何构建镜像、运…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Docker（在面试语境里常指「镜像 + 容器引擎」）解决 单机 上如何构建镜像、运行隔离进程。Kubernetes 解决 多机集群 上如何调度、扩缩、自愈、组网。两者是 上下游协作，不是谁替代谁；现网运行时还多一层 CRI，K8s 不必绑死 Docker。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Docker 做什么"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Dockerfile 构建镜像，分层存储，推送到仓库。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"docker run（或 containerd 的 ctr）在一台宿主机上起停容器，配置网络、挂载、资源限制。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"适合开发本地、CI 构建、单机 compose 编排。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Java 团队典型："},{"t":"code","v":"mvn package"},{"t":"text","v":" → Docker build → push 镜像，这一步还在 K8s 之外完成。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"K8s 做什么"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"声明 Deployment：要几个副本、什么镜像、什么资源 limit。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Scheduler 选 Node，kubelet 在 Node 上起容器（通过 CRI 调 containerd 等）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Service、Ingress、ConfigMap 等解决集群级问题。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"K8s 不构建镜像（构建在 CI）；它 消费 仓库里的镜像。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"历史关系：从 Docker 到 CRI"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"早期 K8s 节点上 kubelet 直接对接 Docker Engine（dockershim）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"后来社区推 CRI（Container Runtime Interface），运行时与 K8s 解耦；dockershim 已移除（1.24+），节点标准做法是 containerd 或 CRI-O 直接接 CRI。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"口述：Docker 造的镜像 OCI 格式，containerd 一样能拉能跑；开发机仍可用 Docker Desktop，集群 Node 跑 containerd 很常见。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"分层理解（背图）"}]},{"type":"code","text":"[ 开发 ] Dockerfile → 镜像 → Registry\n                ↓\n[ K8s ] Deployment 引用镜像 → kubelet → CRI → containerd → 容器进程"},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Docker：制品与单机运行。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"K8s：集群编排与期望状态。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"containerd：Node 上真正起容器的运行时（现网常见）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和 Docker Compose"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Compose 单机多容器；K8s 多机、自愈、滚动发布、RBAC、存储与网络模型更完整。微服务上生产多数选 K8s 或云托管容器服务（底层仍是 K8s 或类似编排）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Java 后端怎么讲项目"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"「我们用 Docker 打镜像进 Harbor，K8s Deployment 三副本 + Service 集群内访问，配置走 ConfigMap，发布滚动更新；节点运行时是 containerd。」"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"这样既准确又体现你懂 CRI 演进，不会只背「K8s = 跑 Docker」。"}]},{"type":"code","text":"flowchart TB\n  DEV[Dockerfile 构建]\n  REG[镜像仓库]\n  K8S[Kubernetes 编排]\n  CRI[containerd/CRI-O]\n  DEV --> REG\n  REG --> K8S\n  K8S --> CRI"}]},{"id":"k8s-Docker和K8s的关系是什么-追问","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"没有 Docker 只有 containerd 怎么 build 镜像？CI 用 b…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"没有 Docker 只有 containerd 怎么 build 镜像？CI 用 buildah/kaniko/docker buildx 等构建，推仓库；Node 只负责 run。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-Docker和K8s的关系是什么"},{"id":"k8s-Docker和K8s的关系是什么-追问-2","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"K8s 能管理虚拟机吗？主流容器；KubeVirt 等可跑 VM，面试一般答容器为主…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"K8s 能管理虚拟机吗？主流容器；KubeVirt 等可跑 VM，面试一般答容器为主。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-Docker和K8s的关系是什么"},{"id":"k8s-Docker和K8s的关系是什么-追问-3","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"Podman 和 Docker 和 K8s？Podman 无 daemon、OCI …","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Podman 和 Docker 和 K8s？Podman 无 daemon、OCI 兼容；K8s 节点不依赖 Podman 除非作运行时集成，逻辑仍是 CRI + 镜像仓库。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-Docker和K8s的关系是什么"},{"id":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行存储管理","module":"k8s","title":"在Kubernetes中如何进行存储管理","level":"core","summary":"容器文件系统默认可写层随 Pod 删除而丢失，数据库、上传文件、日志落盘等需要独立于…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"容器文件系统默认可写层随 Pod 删除而丢失，数据库、上传文件、日志落盘等需要独立于 Pod 生命周期的存储。K8s 用 Volume 抽象把存储挂进 Pod；要跨节点、跨重启持久化，再往上走 PV / PVC（详见下一题）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Volume 是什么"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Volume 是 Pod spec 里声明的一块存储，挂载到容器路径（如 "},{"t":"code","v":"/data"},{"t":"text","v":"）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"同一个 Pod 内多容器可 共享 同一 Volume（如 Sidecar 与主容器共享日志目录）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Volume 的类型决定数据存在哪、能活多久。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"常见 Volume 类型（口述）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"emptyDir：Pod 调度到节点上时创建，Pod 删除则清空；适合临时缓存、多容器共享 scratch。可选介质 memory（tmpfs）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"hostPath：挂载节点本地路径；Pod 重建若调度到别的 Node 数据不在，不适合通用持久化，多用于 DaemonSet 读节点日志、监控 agent 等。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"configMap / secret：配置与敏感信息以文件或 env 注入，不是大块业务数据盘。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"NFS / CephFS / iSCSI 等：对接集群外或分布式存储，由管理员或 PV 预先配置。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"persistentVolumeClaim：在 Pod 里引用 PVC 名，由 PVC 绑定 PV 或 StorageClass 动态创建 的卷，是生产持久化的主路径。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"挂载方式"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"volumeMounts"},{"t":"text","v":" 指定容器内 "},{"t":"code","v":"mountPath"},{"t":"text","v":"；可选 "},{"t":"code","v":"subPath"},{"t":"text","v":" 只挂卷内子目录。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"只读："},{"t":"code","v":"readOnly: true"},{"t":"text","v":"（视存储类型与 PV 访问模式而定）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"持久化存储的整体思路"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"临时 / 节点本地：emptyDir、hostPath（知悉风险再用）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"声明式持久化：集群管理员或 StorageClass 提供 PV；开发/业务写 PVC 要容量和 ReadWriteOnce / ReadOnlyMany / ReadWriteMany；绑定后 Pod 通过 "},{"t":"code","v":"persistentVolumeClaim"},{"t":"text","v":" 引用。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"云盘：云厂商 CSI 驱动 + StorageClass（如 "},{"t":"code","v":"gp3"},{"t":"text","v":"、"},{"t":"code","v":"cloud-ssd"},{"t":"text","v":"），PVC 创建时 动态供给 一块盘并挂到 Pod 所在 Node。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和 Java 应用"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"无状态 Spring 服务通常只挂 emptyDir 或完全不挂盘；MySQL、Redis 持久化 用 StatefulSet + PVC 更常见。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"上传文件若不做对象存储，需 ReadWriteMany 类存储（NFS 等）或改架构走 OSS/S3。"}]},{"type":"code","text":"flowchart TB\n  Pod[Pod]\n  Vol[Volume 抽象]\n  ED[emptyDir 临时]\n  PVC[persistentVolumeClaim]\n  PV[PV / 动态卷]\n  Pod --> Vol\n  Vol --> ED\n  Vol --> PVC --> PV"},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"访问模式一句"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"RWO 单节点读写最常见（块存储）；RWX 要多 Pod 同时写同一卷，要选 NFS 等支持多挂载的后端。"}]}]},{"id":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行存储管理-追问","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"Pod 删了 PVC 还在吗？PVC 是独立对象，一般还在；是否删 PVC 会触发 …","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Pod 删了 PVC 还在吗？PVC 是独立对象，一般还在；是否删 PVC 会触发 PV 回收策略（Retain/Delete）要看配置。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行存储管理"},{"id":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行存储管理-追问-2","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"emptyDir 能跨容器共享吗？能，同一 Pod 内多个容器 mount 同一 e…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"emptyDir 能跨容器共享吗？能，同一 Pod 内多个容器 mount 同一 emptyDir 名即可。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行存储管理"},{"id":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行存储管理-追问-3","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"hostPath 生产为什么慎用？Pod 漂移后数据不在、多 Pod 可能写同一节点…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"hostPath 生产为什么慎用？Pod 漂移后数据不在、多 Pod 可能写同一节点路径冲突，还有安全风险。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行存储管理"},{"id":"k8s-说说PV和PVC","module":"k8s","title":"说说PV和PVC","level":"core","summary":"PV（PersistentVolume） 是集群里的存储资源（一块 NFS 导出、云…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"PV（PersistentVolume） 是集群里的存储资源（一块 NFS 导出、云盘、Ceph 卷等）；PVC（PersistentVolumeClaim） 是用户在命名空间里声明「我要多大、什么访问模式」 的请求。两者 绑定 后，Pod 通过挂载 PVC 使用存储，与 Pod 生命周期解耦。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"为什么要拆 PV 和 PVC"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"管理员管底层存储、配额、性能等级（PV / StorageClass）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"开发者只写 PVC，不必知道 NFS 服务器 IP 或云盘 ID。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"实现 存储即服务：同一套集群，不同 Namespace 各申各的 PVC。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"PV 关键字段"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"capacity：容量（如 10Gi）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"accessModes：RWO、ROX、RWX（与存储后端能力匹配）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"persistentVolumeReclaimPolicy：PVC 释放后 PV 怎么办——Retain（保留数据人工处理）、Delete（动态卷常随 PVC 删云盘）、Recycle（已废弃思路）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"storageClassName：标识存储「类」，动态供给时与 StorageClass 关联。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"PVC 关键字段"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"resources.requests.storage：要的容量。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"accessModes、storageClassName：须与能绑定的 PV 或供给器匹配。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"状态：Pending（等绑定或动态创建）、Bound、Lost 等。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"绑定流程（静态）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"管理员创建 PV（已存在的一块存储）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"用户创建 PVC。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"控制面 PersistentVolumeController 找容量、访问模式、StorageClass 都匹配 且 Available 的 PV，一对一 Bind。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Pod spec 里 "},{"t":"code","v":"volumes.persistentVolumeClaim.claimName: my-pvc"},{"t":"text","v":"，kubelet 在挂载阶段把卷挂到 Node 再进容器。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"没有合适 PV 时 PVC 一直 Pending（除非走动态供给）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"StorageClass 与动态供给"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"StorageClass 描述「用哪种 provisioner、什么参数」创建卷（如 AWS EBS CSI、"},{"t":"code","v":"type: gp3"},{"t":"text","v":"）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"PVC 带上 storageClassName（或集群 default SC）且没有可绑的静态 PV 时，provisioner 自动创建 PV 并 Bind——这是云上最常用的路径。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"口述准确：不是「建了 PVC 就一定自动新建 PV」；要么 预先有匹配的 PV，要么 StorageClass + 动态供给器 才会创建。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Pod 如何使用"}]},{"type":"code","text":"# 口述结构即可\nvolumes:\n  - name: data\n    persistentVolumeClaim:\n      claimName: mysql-pvc\ncontainers:\n  - volumeMounts:\n      - name: data\n        mountPath: /var/lib/mysql"},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"StatefulSet 常为每个副本自动生成 独立 PVC（volumeClaimTemplates），保证有状态实例各有一块盘。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"与第 14 题呼应"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Volume 是 Pod 侧挂载点；PVC 是 Volume 的一种来源，背后 PV 才是真实存储。临时数据用 emptyDir，持久化用 PVC。"}]}]},{"id":"k8s-说说PV和PVC-追问","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"一个 PV 能绑多个 PVC 吗？一对一绑定；要多 Pod 共享同一数据用 RWX …","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"一个 PV 能绑多个 PVC 吗？一对一绑定；要多 Pod 共享同一数据用 RWX + 支持多挂载的后端，或各 Pod 各 PVC 复制数据（看场景）。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说PV和PVC"},{"id":"k8s-说说PV和PVC-追问-2","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"PVC Pending 怎么查？kubectl describe pvc 看 Eve…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"PVC Pending 怎么查？"},{"t":"code","v":"kubectl describe pvc"},{"t":"text","v":" 看 Events：无匹配 PV、StorageClass 不存在、provisioner 失败、配额不足等。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说PV和PVC"},{"id":"k8s-说说PV和PVC-追问-3","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"扩容 PVC 可以吗？很多 StorageClass 支持 PVC 扩容（需 all…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"扩容 PVC 可以吗？很多 StorageClass 支持 PVC 扩容（需 allowVolumeExpansion）；文件系统扩容有时要在 Node 上 growfs，视 CSI 实现。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说PV和PVC"},{"id":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行日志和监控管理","module":"k8s","title":"在Kubernetes中如何进行日志和监控管理","level":"core","summary":"K8s 本身不替应用写日志文件到固定目录；主流是容器进程写 stdout/stder…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"K8s 本身不替应用写日志文件到固定目录；主流是容器进程写 stdout/stderr，由节点或集群级方案采集、检索、告警。监控则从 metrics-server / Prometheus 拿指标，Grafana 展示；Heapster 已废弃，面试勿再当标准答案。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"应用日志怎么出来"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"容器运行时（containerd/CRI-O）按 CRI 日志驱动 把 stdout/stderr 写到节点上（常见 json-file 或 journald），路径在 Node 本地。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"kubectl logs pod名 [-c 容器] [--previous] 读的是当前或上一轮容器标准输出，开发排错第一工具。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"多副本没有统一 "},{"t":"code","v":"kubectl logs"},{"t":"text","v":"；要靠集中式日志按 Pod/Namespace/标签查询。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"集中日志常见架构"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"节点 Agent：Fluent Bit、Fluentd、Filebeat 等 DaemonSet，读容器日志文件或容器引擎接口，打上 K8s 元数据（namespace、pod、labels），转发到 Elasticsearch（EFK）、Loki、云日志服务等。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Sidecar：主容器写文件到共享 emptyDir，Sidecar 容器 tail 并转发（遗留应用改 stdout 前可用）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"口述主路径：stdout → 节点日志 → agent/EFK/Loki；不是「经 kube-proxy 写宿主机业务日志」——kube-proxy 管 Service 流量，与业务日志采集无关。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"监控指标从哪来"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"metrics-server：聚合 Node / Pod 的 CPU、内存 等，供 kubectl top 和 HPA 用；轻量，不是完整监控栈。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Prometheus：通过 kube-state-metrics（对象状态：Deployment 副本、Pod 相位）、node-exporter、应用 /metrics、以及抓取各组件指标，做时序存储与告警（Alertmanager）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Grafana：对接 Prometheus 等做大盘。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"kube-apiserver 暴露 /metrics（HTTPS），可给 Prometheus 抓控制面健康与请求量。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"可观测性三板斧（口述）"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 维度 | 常用手段 |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"|------|----------|"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 日志 | stdout + DaemonSet agent + EFK/Loki |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 指标 | Prometheus + Grafana + metrics-server |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 链路 | Jaeger/Tempo、SkyWalking 等（应用层，非 K8s 内置） |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和 Java 应用"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Logback/Log4j2 配 Console Appender，别只写容器内文件否则易丢、难采。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Spring Boot Actuator "},{"t":"code","v":"/actuator/prometheus"},{"t":"text","v":" 给 Prometheus 抓；JVM 内存、GC 可接 Micrometer。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"生产按 Namespace/label 做日志 retention 与告警（错误率、OOMKilled）。"}]},{"type":"code","text":"flowchart LR\n  App[应用 stdout]\n  Node[节点容器日志]\n  Agent[Fluent Bit DaemonSet]\n  Store[ES / Loki]\n  App --> Node --> Agent --> Store\n  Prom[Prometheus]\n  GS[metrics-server]\n  GS --> Prom"}]},{"id":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行日志和监控管理-追问","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"Pod 重启后旧日志还能 kubectl logs 吗？上一轮用 --previou…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Pod 重启后旧日志还能 kubectl logs 吗？上一轮用 "},{"t":"code","v":"--previous"},{"t":"text","v":"；更久靠集中日志系统 retention。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行日志和监控管理"},{"id":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行日志和监控管理-追问-2","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"metrics-server 和 Prometheus 区别？前者轻量给 top/H…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"metrics-server 和 Prometheus 区别？前者轻量给 top/HPA；后者全功能时序库+告警，抓面更广。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行日志和监控管理"},{"id":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行日志和监控管理-追问-3","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"每个 Node 都要装日志 agent 吗？DaemonSet 保证每节点一份，避免…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"每个 Node 都要装日志 agent 吗？DaemonSet 保证每节点一份，避免 Pod 漂移后漏采。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行日志和监控管理"},{"id":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行故障恢复和自我修复","module":"k8s","title":"在Kubernetes中如何进行故障恢复和自我修复","level":"core","summary":"K8s 的设计目标是 声明期望状态，由控制器持续调谐；节点或容器出问题时有重启、重调…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"K8s 的设计目标是 声明期望状态，由控制器持续调谐；节点或容器出问题时有重启、重调度、摘流量等机制。完全「无人值守」不现实，但大部分常见故障能自动缓解，剩下靠 describe/logs/events 人工介入。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"控制器维持副本与对象关系"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Deployment → ReplicaSet → Pod：某 Pod 被删或节点失联导致 Pod 消失，ReplicaSet 发现 实际副本 < desired，经 apiserver 再创建 Pod。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"StatefulSet、DaemonSet 同理，各自规则（有序、每节点一份）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"这是最基本的 自我修复：进程挂了 Pod 还在则靠探针；Pod 没了就 重建。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"容器级：重启策略与探针"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"restartPolicy：Always / OnFailure / Never（Job 常用 OnFailure 或 Never）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Liveness 失败 → kubelet 杀容器并重启（死锁、无响应）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Readiness 失败 → 不重启，从 Service 摘掉，避免坏实例接流量；恢复后再入池。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Startup 保护慢启动，避免被 liveness 误杀。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"节点级：NotReady 与驱逐"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"kubelet 定期向 apiserver 上报心跳；长时间无心跳，Node 控制器 标记 Node NotReady/Unknown。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"带 toleration 超时 后，控制面可能 驱逐 该节点上的 Pod（Eviction），Pod 变为 Pending 后由 scheduler 重新调度 到健康节点（若资源够）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"有 PodDisruptionBudget 时，自愿/非自愿中断会受「最少可用副本」约束。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"存储与调度"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"挂 RWO PVC 的 Pod 重调度时，卷只能挂到能访问该盘的 Node（云盘常跟可用区绑），scheduler 会考虑 VolumeBinding；排错时看 PVC/PV 与节点 AZ。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"人工排查套路（面试常问「你怎么查」）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"kubectl get pod -o wide"},{"t":"text","v":" 看状态、Restarts、Node。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"kubectl describe pod"},{"t":"text","v":" 看 Events（FailedScheduling、FailedMount、Probe 失败、OOMKilled）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"kubectl logs"},{"t":"text","v":" / "},{"t":"code","v":"--previous"},{"t":"text","v":" 看应用栈。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"节点问题："},{"t":"code","v":"kubectl describe node"},{"t":"text","v":"、看 NotReady 原因（磁盘压力、PLEG、网络）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"控制面：apiserver/etcd 异常会导致无法新建/更新对象，已有 Pod 可能仍跑。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和发布、配置"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"错误镜像或配置靠 滚动更新 + rollout undo 回滚，不算自动修复但是 快速恢复 手段。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"ConfigMap 变更默认不重启 Pod，误配需 rollout restart 或改 template 触发滚动。"}]},{"type":"code","text":"flowchart TD\n  Fail[容器/节点故障]\n  Probe[探针/ kubelet]\n  Ctrl[控制器]\n  Sched[调度器]\n  Fail --> Probe\n  Probe -->|重启容器| Pod[新容器]\n  Fail -->|Pod 丢失| Ctrl\n  Ctrl -->|创建 Pod| Sched\n  Sched --> Pod"}]},{"id":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行故障恢复和自我修复-追问","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"CrashLoopBackOff 是什么？容器反复启动失败，kubelet 指数退避…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"CrashLoopBackOff 是什么？容器反复启动失败，kubelet 指数退避 再起；查 logs 和 liveness/镜像/命令。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行故障恢复和自我修复"},{"id":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行故障恢复和自我修复-追问-2","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"Node NotReady 上 Pod 立刻消失吗？不会立刻；有 pod-evict…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Node NotReady 上 Pod 立刻消失吗？不会立刻；有 pod-eviction-timeout 等 grace，之后才可能被驱逐重调度。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行故障恢复和自我修复"},{"id":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行故障恢复和自我修复-追问-3","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"Deployment 和裸 Pod 恢复区别？裸 Pod 没人补；Deploymen…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Deployment 和裸 Pod 恢复区别？裸 Pod 没人补；Deployment 管理的会被 ReplicaSet 自动补副本。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行故障恢复和自我修复"},{"id":"k8s-灰度发布蓝绿部署金丝雀有什么区别","module":"k8s","title":"灰度发布蓝绿部署金丝雀有什么区别","level":"core","summary":"三者都是降低发版风险的策略：控制多少用户/流量看到新版本、出问题多快切回。K8s D…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"三者都是降低发版风险的策略：控制多少用户/流量看到新版本、出问题多快切回。K8s Deployment 滚动更新是默认「逐步换 Pod」，和下面三种概念可组合，但金丝雀/蓝绿/灰度更强调流量比例与环境隔离。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"灰度发布（Gradual Rollout）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"含义较宽：新版本逐步放量——先 5%、再 20%、再 100%，观察错误率、延迟。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"实现：Ingress 权重、服务网格（Istio VirtualService）、多副本比例、或外部网关分流。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"特点：同一条业务线上新旧版本可能同时在线，按规则分流量。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"蓝绿部署（Blue-Green）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"两套完整环境：蓝（当前生产）、绿（新版本），同一时刻只有一套接全量流量。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"验证绿环境（功能、压测）后，一切换（改 Service selector、改 Ingress 后端、或 LB 指向）流量从蓝到绿；出问题秒级切回蓝。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"特点：资源双倍（两套都要能扛全量或至少验证容量）；切换快，回滚快；不是「慢慢混流量」而是整池切换。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"金丝雀（Canary）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"名字来自煤矿金丝雀：先放少量新版本「探路」。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"小比例流量（如 1%～5%）到新版本，监控告警正常再加大；异常则缩金丝雀、保持旧版为主。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和「灰度」口语常混用；严格说金丝雀强调小流量试探 + 指标门禁，灰度强调分阶段放量整条曲线。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"三者对比（口述表）"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| | 流量方式 | 资源 | 回滚 |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"|---|----------|------|------|"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 蓝绿 | 全量切一套 | 常需双份 | 切回蓝 |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 金丝雀 | 先极小比例 | 增量副本 | 缩新、留旧 |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"| 灰度 | 分阶段加大 | 介于之间 | 降比例或停新 |"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"在 K8s 里的落地印象"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Deployment 滚动：换 Pod，默认 Service 全打到 Ready 的新 Pod（无比例控制）；要比例需 两个 Deployment（stable + canary）+ Ingress/Nginx canary annotation 或 Istio。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"蓝绿：两个 Deployment（或两套 Service），Ingress/LB 一次改 backend；或用 Argo Rollouts、Flagger 等 CRD 自动化。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"金丝雀：canary Deployment replicas 很少 + 权重路由；配合 Prometheus 告警做 自动晋升/回滚（进阶）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"和 Java 团队"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"微服务多服务时，金丝雀常按 入口服务 或 单服务先试；数据库 schema 变更要兼容新旧双读双写，否则只切流量不够。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"镜像 tag 固定版本，便于蓝绿两套指向不同 tag。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"面试收束：滚动换 Pod 解决「无 downtime 替换」；蓝绿/金丝雀/灰度 解决「流量怎么切、多快回滚」，常要 Ingress 或网格配合。"}]}]},{"id":"k8s-灰度发布蓝绿部署金丝雀有什么区别-追问","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"Deployment 滚动算金丝雀吗？不算严格金丝雀；是全量 Ready 新 Pod…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Deployment 滚动算金丝雀吗？不算严格金丝雀；是全量 Ready 新 Pod 逐步替换，无内置 1% 流量。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-灰度发布蓝绿部署金丝雀有什么区别"},{"id":"k8s-灰度发布蓝绿部署金丝雀有什么区别-追问-2","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"蓝绿缺点？双倍资源成本；有状态、长连接要考虑切换时 session 与数据一致。","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"蓝绿缺点？双倍资源成本；有状态、长连接要考虑切换时 session 与数据一致。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-灰度发布蓝绿部署金丝雀有什么区别"},{"id":"k8s-灰度发布蓝绿部署金丝雀有什么区别-追问-3","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"Ingress Nginx 怎么做金丝雀？canary/canary-weight …","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Ingress Nginx 怎么做金丝雀？"},{"t":"code","v":"canary"},{"t":"text","v":"/"},{"t":"code","v":"canary-weight"},{"t":"text","v":" 注解把部分流量指到 canary Service。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-灰度发布蓝绿部署金丝雀有什么区别"},{"id":"k8s-简述Etcd的作用和基本原理","module":"k8s","title":"简述Etcd的作用和基本原理","level":"core","summary":"etcd 是 K8s 控制面的唯一持久化存储（通过 apiserver 访问）：所有…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"etcd 是 K8s 控制面的唯一持久化存储（通过 apiserver 访问）：所有 API 对象（Pod、Deployment、ConfigMap、Secret 等）的期望与实际状态都以键值形式存在 etcd 里。apiserver 无状态可多副本，数据真相在 etcd。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"在 K8s 里做什么"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"持久化集群配置与对象；apiserver 写成功才认为变更生效。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"提供 watch 能力基础：组件 List-Watch 靠 etcd 的 revision 与事件流（经 apiserver 封装）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"resourceVersion 与乐观并发控制，避免覆盖写。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"备份 etcd ≈ 备份整个集群「意图」；灾难恢复靠 snapshot 恢复 后 apiserver 重连。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"业务 Pod 不直连 etcd；只有 apiserver（及运维工具经 apiserver）正规读写。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"基本原理：分布式 KV + Raft"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"etcd 是分布式键值存储，强调 强一致（线性一致读可通过 quorum 读实现，写走 Raft）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Raft 共识：集群选 Leader，写请求由 Leader 复制到多数派（quorum）才提交；Follower 同步日志。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"奇数节点（3、5、7）：容忍 (N-1)/2 节点故障；3 节点挂 1 个仍可用，挂 2 个丧失 quorum 集群不可写（可能不可读取决于实现与读模式）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"数据落盘 WAL + snapshot，重启可回放；生产 SSD、独立网络、定期 snapshot 备份 到对象存储。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"与 apiserver 的分工"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"客户端只打 apiserver；apiserver 校验后 translate 成 etcd key（如 "},{"t":"code","v":"/registry/pods/default/my-pod"},{"t":"text","v":"）读写。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"etcd 不知道 Pod/Service 语义，只存字节；语义在 apiserver 与内置 API machinery。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"运维口述要点"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"勿把 etcd 当应用缓存或自己写客户端改数据（破坏一致性）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"升级 K8s 注意 etcd 版本兼容 矩阵。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"性能：对象过多、事件过多会增加 etcd 压力；大 ConfigMap、频繁 watch 要治理。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"恢复演练：定期做 snapshot restore 到测试环境，验证备份可用，避免真故障才发现备份损坏。"}]},{"type":"code","text":"flowchart LR\n  K[kubectl/控制器]\n  API[kube-apiserver]\n  E[(etcd Raft 集群)]\n  K --> API --> E"}]},{"id":"k8s-简述Etcd的作用和基本原理-追问","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"etcd 挂了 Pod 还运行吗？已在 Node 上的容器可能继续跑，但调度、扩缩、…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"etcd 挂了 Pod 还运行吗？已在 Node 上的容器可能继续跑，但调度、扩缩、更新 Service 等依赖 apiserver→etcd，会瘫痪。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-简述Etcd的作用和基本原理"},{"id":"k8s-简述Etcd的作用和基本原理-追问-2","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"为什么推荐 3 或 5 节点？Raft quorum 与故障容忍；偶数节点浪费且易脑…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"为什么推荐 3 或 5 节点？Raft quorum 与故障容忍；偶数节点浪费且易脑裂配置不当。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-简述Etcd的作用和基本原理"},{"id":"k8s-简述Etcd的作用和基本原理-追问-3","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"etcd 和 Redis 能互换吗？不能；K8s 依赖 etcd 的一致性模型与 a…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"etcd 和 Redis 能互换吗？不能；K8s 依赖 etcd 的一致性模型与 apiserver 集成，Redis 非 K8s 官方存储后端。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-简述Etcd的作用和基本原理"},{"id":"k8s-说说Kubernetes调度器","module":"k8s","title":"说说Kubernetes调度器","level":"core","summary":"kube-scheduler 负责给 尚未绑定 nodeName 的 Pod 选一台…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"kube-scheduler 负责给 尚未绑定 nodeName 的 Pod 选一台 Node，并把绑定结果写回 apiserver。创建 Pod 对象不等于立刻在机器上跑——调度成功后 kubelet 才会在本机拉起容器。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"调度在整体流程中的位置"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"用户/控制器创建 Pod → apiserver 入 etcd，spec.nodeName 为空。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Scheduler watch 到可调度 Pod（通过 调度队列）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"选定 Node → Bind（Patch "},{"t":"code","v":"spec.nodeName"},{"t":"text","v":"）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"对应 kubelet watch 到绑定本机的 Pod → 拉镜像、创容器。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"已绑定 nodeName 的 Pod 不会再被默认调度器重调度（除非被删除重建或某些特殊流程）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"两阶段：过滤 + 打分"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"现代调度框架（Scheduling Framework）口语仍可说 Predicates（过滤） 与 Priorities（打分）："}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"过滤：硬性条件不满足则节点淘汰——资源 request 是否够（CPU/内存/ephemeral-storage）、端口冲突、NodeSelector、亲和/反亲和、污点 Toleration、PVC VolumeBinding（未绑定卷的延迟调度）、Pod 拓扑分布约束等。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"打分：剩余节点按策略加权——资源均衡（LeastAllocated、MostAllocated）、亲和权重、ImageLocality（节点已有镜像）、自定义插件分数。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"取得分最高者；并列时伪随机或轮换，避免总打同一节点。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"调度器配置与扩展"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"默认 kube-scheduler 一个进程，通常 Leader Election 多副本只有 leader 干活。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"可配置 多个调度器：Pod 的 "},{"t":"code","v":"spec.schedulerName"},{"t":"text","v":" 指定用哪一个（批任务、GPU 专用等）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Scheduling Framework 插件：PreFilter、Filter、Score、Bind、Permit 等扩展点，二次开发不用改核心源码。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Preemption：高优先级 Pod 可能驱逐低优先级 Pod 腾资源（启用 PriorityClass 时）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"常见 Pending 原因（和调度相关）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Insufficient cpu/memory"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"No nodes match node selector / affinity"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Taint 无 toleration"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"PVC 未 Bound 且 WaitForFirstConsumer"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"集群无 Ready Node"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"kubectl describe pod"},{"t":"text","v":" 的 Events 里 scheduler 会写原因。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"与控制器区别（防混）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Scheduler：选 Node，一次绑定。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Controller：维持副本数、Endpoint、Deployment 层级等，不负责首次选机（DaemonSet 除外，其控制器指定每 Node 一份）。"}]}]},{"id":"k8s-说说Kubernetes调度器-追问","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"Pod 能指定跑在某节点吗？nodeName 直接指定（绕过调度器逻辑少）；更推荐 …","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Pod 能指定跑在某节点吗？"},{"t":"code","v":"nodeName"},{"t":"text","v":" 直接指定（绕过调度器逻辑少）；更推荐 "},{"t":"code","v":"nodeSelector"},{"t":"text","v":" / "},{"t":"code","v":"nodeAffinity"},{"t":"text","v":"。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说Kubernetes调度器"},{"id":"k8s-说说Kubernetes调度器-追问-2","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"亲和和反亲和？affinity 把 Pod 拉近/远离某类 Node 或某 Pod；…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"亲和和反亲和？affinity 把 Pod 拉近/远离某类 Node 或某 Pod；反亲和 spread 多副本防同机。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说Kubernetes调度器"},{"id":"k8s-说说Kubernetes调度器-追问-3","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"调度失败会一直重试吗？会周期性重入队列，直到有合适 Node 或 Pod 被删。","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"调度失败会一直重试吗？会周期性重入队列，直到有合适 Node 或 Pod 被删。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说Kubernetes调度器"},{"id":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行服务负载均衡","module":"k8s","title":"在Kubernetes中如何进行服务负载均衡","level":"core","summary":"集群内多 Pod 副本对外应像一个服务；负载均衡分 四层（Service + kub…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"集群内多 Pod 副本对外应像一个服务；负载均衡分 四层（Service + kube-proxy） 与 七层（Ingress 等），和 09 Service/Ingress 一脉相承，这题偏「流量怎么分」。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"集群内四层：Service"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Service 提供稳定 ClusterIP（或 None） 与 DNS；后端是匹配 label selector 的 Pod IP 列表（Endpoints / EndpointSlice）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"访问 "},{"t":"code","v":"ServiceIP:port"},{"t":"text","v":" 时，节点上 kube-proxy（iptables / IPVS / 部分环境 eBPF）把连接 DNAT/负载均衡 到某一 Ready Pod IP。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"默认 kube-proxy 模式 下是 随机或轮询 类行为（视 IPVS 会话亲和 sessionAffinity 配置）；sessionAffinity: ClientIP 可同源 IP 粘到同一 Pod（有 TTL）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Only Ready Pod 进 Endpoints：Readiness 失败的不分担流量。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"集群外四层"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"NodePort：每 Node 同一高端口 → kube-proxy 再分到 Pod。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"LoadBalancer：云控制器申请 外部 LB，流量进 Node/ Pod 网络（实现因云而异）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"外部 LB + NodePort 是常见「对外四层」组合。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"七层：Ingress"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"HTTP/HTTPS 按 Host、Path 路由到不同 Service；负载均衡在 Ingress Controller（Nginx、Traefik 等）里做，可 加权、金丝雀、TLS。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"路径："},{"t":"code","v":"Client → LB/Ingress Controller → Service ClusterIP → kube-proxy → Pod"},{"t":"text","v":"。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Headless Service"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"clusterIP: None"},{"t":"text","v":"：DNS A 记录返回所有 Pod IP，客户端或中间件自己做负载均衡（如 StatefulSet 下 Kafka、某些 gRPC client lb）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"与 CNI / Service Mesh"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"部分 CNI（Cilium 等）用 eBPF 替代或增强 kube-proxy 数据面。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Istio/Linkerd 在 Sidecar 做 L7 负载均衡、重试、熔断，Service 仍作服务发现入口。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Java 侧印象"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"集群内调下游用 Service DNS，JVM HTTP 客户端 每次解析可能拿到不同 Pod IP（Headless 则多个 A 记录）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"需要强会话粘滞时：Ingress cookie、Service sessionAffinity，或业务层 token 路由。"}]},{"type":"code","text":"flowchart TB\n  C[客户端]\n  ING[Ingress 七层 LB]\n  SVC[Service ClusterIP]\n  KP[kube-proxy 四层]\n  P1[Pod]\n  P2[Pod]\n  C --> ING --> SVC --> KP\n  KP --> P1\n  KP --> P2"}]},{"id":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行服务负载均衡-追问","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"kube-proxy 在每个 Node 都有吗？是 DaemonSet/静态 Pod…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"kube-proxy 在每个 Node 都有吗？是 DaemonSet/静态 Pod，保证本 Node 访问 Service 能转发。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行服务负载均衡"},{"id":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行服务负载均衡-追问-2","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"Service 和 Endpoints 谁维护？EndpointSlice 控制器根…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Service 和 Endpoints 谁维护？EndpointSlice 控制器根据 Pod label 与 Ready 状态自动更新。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行服务负载均衡"},{"id":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行服务负载均衡-追问-3","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"Ingress 做 TCP 负载均衡吗？标准 Ingress 偏 HTTP；TCP …","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Ingress 做 TCP 负载均衡吗？标准 Ingress 偏 HTTP；TCP 用 Ingress Controller 扩展或 Gateway API / Service LB。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-在Kubernetes中如何进行服务负载均衡"},{"id":"k8s-说说Labels和Selectors","module":"k8s","title":"说说Labels和Selectors","level":"core","summary":"Label 是挂在 K8s 对象（Pod、Node、Service 等）上的 键值对…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Label 是挂在 K8s 对象（Pod、Node、Service 等）上的 键值对 元数据，用于分组、选择、关联。Selector 是「按 label 筛对象」的规则；Service → Pod、Deployment → Pod、kubectl 过滤都靠这套机制。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Label 怎么写"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"键值均为字符串，如 "},{"t":"code","v":"app: nginx"},{"t":"text","v":"、"},{"t":"code","v":"env: prod"},{"t":"text","v":"、"},{"t":"code","v":"version: v2"},{"t":"text","v":"。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"推荐 app.kubernetes.io/name 等推荐标签（非强制），便于跨团队统一。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"在 metadata.labels 里；Deployment 的 template.metadata.labels 会打到它创建的 Pod 上。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Selector 两种形式"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"equality-based（等值）："},{"t":"code","v":"key=value"},{"t":"text","v":"、"},{"t":"code","v":"key==value"},{"t":"text","v":"、"},{"t":"code","v":"key!=value"},{"t":"text","v":"。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"set-based（集合）："},{"t":"code","v":"key in (v1,v2)"},{"t":"text","v":"、"},{"t":"code","v":"key notin (...)"},{"t":"text","v":"、"},{"t":"code","v":"key"},{"t":"text","v":" 存在、"},{"t":"code","v":"!key"},{"t":"text","v":" 不存在。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Deployment 的 "},{"t":"code","v":"spec.selector.matchLabels"},{"t":"text","v":" 必须与 Pod template 的 labels 一致且不可随意改（immutable 约束），否则 orphan 旧 Pod。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"典型关联"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Service："},{"t":"code","v":"spec.selector"},{"t":"text","v":" 匹配 Pod labels → 这些 Pod IP 进 Endpoints。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Deployment / ReplicaSet：selector 匹配 Pod template labels → 控制器认哪些 Pod 归我管。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"kubectl："},{"t":"code","v":"kubectl get pod -l app=nginx,env!=dev"},{"t":"text","v":"。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Node 上的 Label"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"运维给 Node 打 "},{"t":"code","v":"disktype=ssd"},{"t":"text","v":"、"},{"t":"code","v":"zone=cn-north-1a"},{"t":"text","v":"；Pod 用 nodeSelector 或 nodeAffinity 只调度到带某 label 的节点。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Label 与 Annotation 区别"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Label：短、可索引、给 selector 用。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Annotation：较大或非标量（构建号、Git SHA、滚动触发戳），不参与 selector，给人和工具读。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"设计实践（口述）"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"一套 Deployment 一套核心 label（"},{"t":"code","v":"app"},{"t":"text","v":" + "},{"t":"code","v":"version"},{"t":"text","v":"）；Service 通常只选 "},{"t":"code","v":"app"},{"t":"text","v":"，version 留给金丝雀 多 Deployment 分流。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"勿用会变的 label 做 Service selector（如 "},{"t":"code","v":"version"},{"t":"text","v":" 若单 Deployment 滚动会变乱）。"}]},{"type":"code","text":"flowchart LR\n  SVC[Service selector app=web]\n  P1[Pod app=web v1]\n  P2[Pod app=web v2]\n  SVC --> P1\n  SVC --> P2"}]},{"id":"k8s-说说Labels和Selectors-追问","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"Service selector 为空会怎样？可能匹配异常或无法正确建 Endpoi…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Service selector 为空会怎样？可能匹配异常或无法正确建 Endpoints，访问无后端；应始终明确 selector。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说Labels和Selectors"},{"id":"k8s-说说Labels和Selectors-追问-2","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"能改 Deployment selector 吗？创建后 matchLabels 不…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"能改 Deployment selector 吗？创建后 matchLabels 不可变；要改需新建 Deployment 并迁移。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说Labels和Selectors"},{"id":"k8s-说说Labels和Selectors-追问-3","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"label 和 fieldSelector 区别？label 是用户自定义 meta…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"label 和 fieldSelector 区别？label 是用户自定义 metadata.labels；fieldSelector 查 status.phase 等系统字段，如 "},{"t":"code","v":"status.phase=Running"},{"t":"text","v":"。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-说说Labels和Selectors"},{"id":"k8s-简述Pod的生命周期","module":"k8s","title":"简述Pod的生命周期","level":"core","summary":"Pod 是 K8s 最小调度单位，生命周期从 Pending 到 Running，再…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Pod 是 K8s 最小调度单位，生命周期从 Pending 到 Running，再到 Succeeded / Failed，或被删除进入 Terminating。理解阶段有助于排错调度、镜像、探针、优雅下线。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"相位（Phase）概览"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Pending：已提交 apiserver，尚未运行——可能在 调度、拉镜像、挂卷、等 Init 容器。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Running：至少一个容器已在跑（含仍在启动中）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Succeeded：所有容器正常退出且 restartPolicy 为 Never/OnFailure 且成功（常见于 Job）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Failed：至少一容器异常退出或系统失败。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Unknown：Node 通信异常，状态暂不可信。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"kubectl get pod"},{"t":"text","v":" 的 STATUS 还有 ContainerCreating、CrashLoopBackOff、Terminating 等更细原因，常看 Conditions 与 Events。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"创建到运行的顺序"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"调度绑定 nodeName（或未调度则 Pending）。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Init Containers（若有）顺序执行，全部成功才起主容器。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"拉镜像、创建 sandbox、挂 Volume、启动容器。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Startup / Liveness / Readiness 探针按配置开始；Readiness 成功才进 Service。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"主容器运行；sidecar 与主容器并行（Init 之后）。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Init 容器"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"先于 app 容器运行，一批跑完再下一批；用于等依赖、迁移脚本、生成配置。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"失败则 Pod 重启策略作用于 Pod 级，Init 失败会重试整个 Pod 启动流程。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"探针与生命周期"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Startup 成功前 liveness/readiness 可不生效。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Readiness 失败：仍 Running 但 Ready=False，不接流量。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Liveness 失败：容器被杀重启，Pod 仍 Running 但 RESTARTS 增加。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"删除与宽限期"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"code","v":"kubectl delete pod"},{"t":"text","v":" 发 SIGTERM 给容器（PID 1），并设 terminationGracePeriodSeconds（默认 30s）等待优雅退出。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"宽限期到仍存活则 SIGKILL。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Pod 有 finalizer 时可能卡在 Terminating，需控制器清 finalizer。"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Deployment 删 Pod 会 补新副本；Job 完成则 Pod 保留或按 ttl 清理。"}]},{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"状态写入"}]},{"type":"li","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"kubelet 经 apiserver 更新 status；控制器根据 phase 做 Job 完成、ReplicaSet 补 Pod 等。"}]},{"type":"code","text":"stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --> Pending\n  Pending --> Running: 调度+Init+容器启动\n  Running --> Succeeded: 正常退出 Job\n  Running --> Failed: 异常退出\n  Running --> Terminating: delete\n  Terminating --> [*]"}]},{"id":"k8s-简述Pod的生命周期-追问","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"Pending 和 ContainerCreating 区别？Pending 含未调…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Pending 和 ContainerCreating 区别？Pending 含未调度；ContainerCreating 已分到 Node，在拉镜像/挂卷。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-简述Pod的生命周期"},{"id":"k8s-简述Pod的生命周期-追问-2","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"Pod 里一个容器退出其它还跑吗？默认 Pod 共享网络；一容器失败可能导致整 Po…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"Pod 里一个容器退出其它还跑吗？默认 Pod 共享网络；一容器失败可能导致整 Pod Failed，视 restartPolicy 与是否 shareProcessNamespace。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-简述Pod的生命周期"},{"id":"k8s-简述Pod的生命周期-追问-3","module":"k8s","title":"追问","level":"extra","summary":"如何优雅下线 Java？preStop hook sleep 几秒 + readin…","blocks":[{"type":"p","inlines":[{"t":"text","v":"如何优雅下线 Java？preStop hook sleep 几秒 + readiness fail + 处理完请求，配合 terminationGracePeriod。"}]}],"parentId":"k8s-简述Pod的生命周期"}]
